notes.content:
Welcome to the developer's diary! Today we will talk about the new add-on to the game "Mao's Legacy".

In this DLC is planned:

[list]
[*] Bigger Branches of Pathways;
[*] New modifiers and indicators for the USSR and the USA;
[*] A large number of new endings for USSR and USA;
[*] A Window of Power for USSR and USA;
[*] New Wars;
[*] New Events;
[*] And the ability to configure before the game rules of the game;
[*] As well as increasing the possibility of interaction with the USSR and U.S.
[/list]

Also will be released update that adds the ability to modify the game. It will be possible to add your own politicians, events, path branches and endings.

[url=https://www.reddit.com/r/Kremlingames/comments/rjzjj0/developers_diary_1_maos_legacy_dlc_empires_strike/]Continued diary with screenshots and descriptions of mechanics here.[/url]
